VALUES ('0f38cd62-3ee7-5ed7-a227-b86a2467ddf5', 'd9d2121a-6c18-5616-9cc9-74a801d51ec5', 1, $json${"prompt":"What are the time complexities of heap push/pop and peek?","multiple":false,"options":[{"id":"a","text":"Push/pop O(log n), peek O(1)","is_correct":true},{"id":"b","text":"Push/pop O(1), peek O(log n)","is_correct":false},{"id":"c","text":"All operations O(log n)","is_correct":false},{"id":"d","text":"Push O(n), pop O(1), peek O(1)","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"Insert and extract sift an element up or down the tree height (O(log n)); the min/max is always at the root, so peek is O(1)."}$json$::jsonb, '00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000012')
ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET content=EXCLUDED.content;

